1
00:00:07,993 --> 00:00:09,860
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:10,011 --> 00:00:12,144
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,206 --> 00:00:17,362
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,233 --> 00:00:22,019
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,804 --> 00:00:27,711
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,426
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,682 --> 00:00:34,971
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,093 --> 00:00:39,528
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,497 --> 00:00:44,164
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,859 --> 00:00:48,935
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,302 --> 00:00:52,928
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,731 --> 00:00:58,126
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,204 --> 00:01:01,964
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,464 --> 00:01:08,326
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,165 --> 00:01:15,779
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:18,611
=Episode 15=

17
00:01:20,519 --> 00:01:21,920
Shen Yanlin

18
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,439
asked to meet you too, didn't he?

19
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:26,560
After Hui died,

20
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:30,120
his wife and child were both...

21
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:31,319
This thing...

22
00:01:31,319 --> 00:01:32,439
It doesn't matter

23
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:33,280
who was behind it.

24
00:01:34,159 --> 00:01:35,000
What happened with Fei Liu

25
00:01:35,439 --> 00:01:36,519
has caused quite a stir.

26
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:39,280
Tai even stepped in for him.

27
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,200
Didn't we agree

28
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:44,400
to meet with someone tonight?

29
00:02:00,959 --> 00:02:02,840
Looks like those old-timers

30
00:02:03,159 --> 00:02:04,040
aren't coming.

31
00:02:22,199 --> 00:02:24,360
I heard nothing ever

32
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,599
kills a handsome guy's appetite.

33
00:02:27,439 --> 00:02:28,319
You handsome?

34
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,599
We're both this good-looking.

35
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:33,879
Let's eat.

36
00:02:35,719 --> 00:02:36,400
Can't argue with that.

37
00:02:41,039 --> 00:02:43,919
Shen Yanlin could take

38
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,560
all these leftovers home.

39
00:02:45,759 --> 00:02:47,879
They'd last him a lifetime.

40
00:02:49,759 --> 00:02:50,439
Boss Liu.

41
00:02:50,919 --> 00:02:52,520
Why waste your time

42
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,240
on those two punks?

43
00:02:55,159 --> 00:02:56,199
There'll be no place for them

44
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:58,240
in the organization anyway.

45
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,719
Why not let

46
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,479
the guys handle the rest?

47
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:04,840
Times have changed.

48
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:08,719
Look at those operations down south.

49
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,199
They're running around the clock.

50
00:03:10,599 --> 00:03:12,000
And aren't they making

51
00:03:12,439 --> 00:03:13,319
the same stuff we used to move?

52
00:03:14,919 --> 00:03:16,120
That old merchandise

53
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:18,120
isn't worth much anymore.

54
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:20,560
When there's no question
of who's the shot-caller,

55
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,319
I plan

56
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:26,080
to make money together
with all the elders.

57
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,879
If the old ways don't work,

58
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:33,319
I'll find a new way forward.

59
00:03:34,599 --> 00:03:35,719
A new way?

60
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:49,360
Tai.

61
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:50,719
I'm afraid

62
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:52,759
that's against the rules.

63
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,000
No change without breaking the old.

64
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,960
Once I become the shot-caller,

65
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,000
I make the rules.

66
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:10,919
Boss Liu.

67
00:04:12,199 --> 00:04:13,120
Tell me,

68
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,479
are those shipping routes

69
00:04:16,079 --> 00:04:17,199
of yours reliable?

70
00:04:20,279 --> 00:04:21,319
Of course.

71
00:04:39,319 --> 00:04:39,959
Get out!

72
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:41,240
Still playing?

73
00:04:41,879 --> 00:04:42,480
Everybody out!

74
00:04:44,759 --> 00:04:45,240
Get lost!

75
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,720
W-What are you doing?

76
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:48,879
Playing games.

77
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:50,399
What else?

78
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:01,839
Give me.

79
00:05:03,279 --> 00:05:04,399
Friend.

80
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,680
My friend.

81
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:09,519
What are you doing?

82
00:05:09,839 --> 00:05:10,240
Fu.

83
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,160
We're from the health department.

84
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,120
We received a report

85
00:05:13,399 --> 00:05:14,439
that there's a problem
with the geese here.

86
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,600
We need to take them away for testing.

87
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:16,759
Here. Sign this.

88
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:22,200
(Notice of Failed Health
and Vaccination Inspection)

89
00:05:37,519 --> 00:05:40,480
Lin, save my friend!

90
00:05:42,519 --> 00:05:43,920
Will you stop making a fuss?

91
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:46,279
Lin is bad!

92
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:53,600
Fu.

93
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:57,279
Fu.

94
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,120
Che is bad too!

95
00:05:59,279 --> 00:06:00,079
I'm on this side.

96
00:06:01,519 --> 00:06:02,040
Bad.

97
00:06:04,199 --> 00:06:04,839
Where are you going?

98
00:06:04,959 --> 00:06:05,800
Leave me alone.

99
00:06:05,959 --> 00:06:06,600
Boss Lin.

100
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:07,920
Fei Liu sent people with reporters

101
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,639
to bust smuggled goods
at the electronics market.

102
00:06:10,079 --> 00:06:11,360
The whole street is sealed off now.

103
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,079
H-He's messing with us!

104
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,879
Most of our businesses can't operate.

105
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:17,759
Every last one of you is useless.

106
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:20,600
(Dongcheng Tiger)
Get out!

107
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,319
Fei Liu is messing with my business.

108
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:30,800
Then I'll mess with his.

109
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:33,079
Fei Liu may not have many businesses,

110
00:06:33,519 --> 00:06:34,839
but Dongshan Tai is behind him.

111
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,279
Going head-to-head won't work.

112
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:37,399
Then we'll catch some snakes

113
00:06:38,519 --> 00:06:39,639
and let them loose
in Dongshan Tai's casino.

114
00:06:39,959 --> 00:06:41,560
Then nobody gets to have it easy.

115
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:44,319
We may not be strong enough

116
00:06:44,319 --> 00:06:45,800
to take Dongshan Tai down right now,

117
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,439
but we can find a way

118
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:50,319
to get him kicked out of the race
for the top position.

119
00:06:52,079 --> 00:06:52,800
You have a plan?

120
00:06:55,519 --> 00:06:57,279
We don't know Dongshan Tai that well,

121
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,680
but we can find out
how his businesses operate

122
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:01,279
and which one makes him the most money.

123
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:04,199
He didn't get to where he is today

124
00:07:04,399 --> 00:07:05,480
and win over those elders

125
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,360
by being ordinary.

126
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,720
But everyone has a weakness.

127
00:07:10,319 --> 00:07:11,079
I'll have the guys look into him.

128
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:13,399
I want everything, above board
or under the table.

129
00:07:51,519 --> 00:07:52,079
Hurry! Hurry!

130
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:52,800
Keep up!

131
00:08:03,079 --> 00:08:03,959
She had nothing to do with it.

132
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:06,079
You want to come down to the station
for a chat?

133
00:08:06,079 --> 00:08:06,920
I'll let you do your job.

134
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:07,839
Sorry.

135
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:11,800
Take her away.

136
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:25,000
How could anyone be dealing drugs
at our place?

137
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,800
It wasn't one of our guys, was it?

138
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,800
They wouldn't dare.

139
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:31,519
Maybe one of the customers
brought it in?

140
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:37,519
What about Annie?

141
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,440
I'll check on her now.

142
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,600
If anything happens to Annie,

143
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,840
whoever's behind this is going to pay.

144
00:08:53,314 --> 00:09:00,000
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant)

145
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,720
The lawyer called.

146
00:09:02,519 --> 00:09:03,919
He said the cops didn't find

147
00:09:04,159 --> 00:09:05,679
any evidence of drug dealing
at our place.

148
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:08,360
But we'll still have to shut down
for a while.

149
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,360
Annie's been released too.

150
00:09:13,759 --> 00:09:14,600
Relax.

151
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:18,000
Who said I was worried?

152
00:09:19,679 --> 00:09:20,519
I just don't get

153
00:09:20,519 --> 00:09:22,240
why you always insist on coming here.

154
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,000
The food takes forever,

155
00:09:24,159 --> 00:09:25,159
and the service is terrible.

156
00:09:26,399 --> 00:09:27,000
See?

157
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:28,399
He looks like we owe him money.

158
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:29,200
Look.

159
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,759
See?

160
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,200
Because they have egg tarts.

161
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:49,960
Those kids using ice had fake IDs.

162
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,120
Several of them were underage.

163
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:51,799
They really screwed me over.

164
00:09:52,919 --> 00:09:54,879
Underage and doing ice?

165
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:57,120
And they almost died at my place?

166
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:01,000
Too many things have gone wrong
at our places lately.

167
00:10:01,279 --> 00:10:03,200
I think Dongshan Tai and Fei Liu
are behind it.

168
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,320
I think so too.

169
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:07,960
But where would Dongshan Tai
get the drugs?

170
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:10,080
Maybe he just wanted to take me down

171
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,840
and had one of his guys get some.

172
00:10:12,159 --> 00:10:13,720
But if we trace the drugs,

173
00:10:14,399 --> 00:10:16,799
we might uncover what Dongshan Tai's
been doing behind the scenes.

174
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:21,759
Oh, you are here.

175
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:24,639
We came together.

176
00:10:27,399 --> 00:10:28,039
Then...

177
00:10:28,519 --> 00:10:29,720
Dongshan Tai

178
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,240
is all yours.

179
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:32,960
Sir, we want some beer.

180
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:33,799
Take it.

181
00:10:38,879 --> 00:10:40,200
Don't drink by yourself.

182
00:10:42,639 --> 00:10:42,960
Here.

183
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:46,960
To you getting out okay.

184
00:10:48,399 --> 00:10:49,840
How does that saying go again?

185
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:52,639
Survive a disaster, and good fortune
follows.

186
00:10:53,039 --> 00:10:54,440
Here's to all of us surviving.

187
00:10:55,759 --> 00:10:56,840
Yes. We're fine.

188
00:10:56,919 --> 00:10:57,200
Cheers.

189
00:10:57,201 --> 00:11:01,649
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant)

190
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:02,799
Three hundred.

191
00:11:04,159 --> 00:11:04,519
Thanks.

192
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:10,519
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant)

193
00:11:10,639 --> 00:11:11,120
Your change.

194
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:11,919
Thanks.

195
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:17,200
(2 slices)

196
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:29,480
(8 slices)

197
00:11:39,639 --> 00:11:40,559
What? What is it?

198
00:11:40,919 --> 00:11:41,919
Just tell me what you want!

199
00:11:41,919 --> 00:11:42,919
I'm from
the Shicheng Royal Police Headquarters.

200
00:11:44,279 --> 00:11:45,399
I need to verify something with you.

201
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:46,559
Go ahead.

202
00:11:48,399 --> 00:11:50,080
Those ecstasy pills you
took at the club,

203
00:11:50,919 --> 00:11:51,519
where did you get them?

204
00:11:51,679 --> 00:11:53,440
Someone gave them to me.

205
00:11:53,919 --> 00:11:54,960
What's his name?

206
00:11:55,759 --> 00:11:56,879
I don't know his real name.

207
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:59,399
Everyone calls him

208
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:02,120
Eagle.

209
00:12:02,679 --> 00:12:04,279
A guy whose real name
you don't even know

210
00:12:04,639 --> 00:12:05,879
just gave you something that expensive?

211
00:12:06,399 --> 00:12:07,200
How come nobody gives me any?

212
00:12:08,559 --> 00:12:09,480
You don't wanna tell the truth?

213
00:12:10,039 --> 00:12:10,759
Go to the police station with me then.

214
00:12:10,759 --> 00:12:12,240
Wait, wait!

215
00:12:12,679 --> 00:12:13,840
I'll talk! I'll talk!

216
00:12:14,399 --> 00:12:14,879
He...

217
00:12:15,679 --> 00:12:18,039
I met him over on Agu Street,

218
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:20,159
at the Great World Arcade.

219
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,320
We played a few games together.

220
00:12:21,799 --> 00:12:22,519
Eagle

221
00:12:22,519 --> 00:12:23,679
was really friendly.

222
00:12:23,879 --> 00:12:25,720
So he gave me some of that stuff.

223
00:12:26,159 --> 00:12:27,559
I'm telling you the truth.

224
00:12:27,559 --> 00:12:29,120
I've told you everything I know.

225
00:12:30,879 --> 00:12:32,000
Don't leave Shicheng for the time being.

226
00:12:32,879 --> 00:12:34,000
I may question you again.

227
00:12:34,919 --> 00:12:35,240
Got it.

228
00:12:35,679 --> 00:12:36,559
T-Then I'll...

229
00:12:37,759 --> 00:12:39,600
Stay away from those people.

230
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:41,240
Don't let me catch you again.

231
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:41,960
Don't worry, Officer.

232
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:43,519
If you ever catch me again,

233
00:12:43,519 --> 00:12:44,600
I'll drop dead right in front of you.

234
00:12:46,039 --> 00:12:47,159
Nobody asked you to die.

235
00:12:51,559 --> 00:12:53,320
You really are a cop, right?

236
00:12:54,679 --> 00:12:55,919
Want me to take you to the station
for a chat?

237
00:12:55,919 --> 00:12:56,799
No, no!

238
00:12:58,919 --> 00:13:00,559
It's just... the look in your eyes

239
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:02,840
is different from
that of the other officers.

240
00:13:10,879 --> 00:13:11,879
Officer.

241
00:13:19,639 --> 00:13:20,639
Officer.

242
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:32,080
(Dongcheng Tiger)
I had Huogun check everywhere.

243
00:13:32,919 --> 00:13:34,000
There isn't anyone

244
00:13:34,519 --> 00:13:35,759
in Dongcheng Gang called Eagle.

245
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,480
He must be using an alias.

246
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:41,279
But Great World Arcade
isn't on Dongcheng turf.

247
00:13:42,639 --> 00:13:44,159
Nothing we have so far

248
00:13:45,159 --> 00:13:47,879
ties this to Fei Liu or Dongshan Tai.

249
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,440
Could the ecstasy

250
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:51,080
just be a coincidence?

251
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,039
I still think

252
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:55,240
they had something to do with it.

253
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:58,559
Dongshan Tai probably thinks

254
00:13:58,559 --> 00:14:00,000
he's got the shot-caller role
locked down.

255
00:14:02,159 --> 00:14:04,279
That's exactly why I won't let him
have it.

256
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:07,720
Can we get more of those ecstasy pills?

257
00:14:42,320 --> 00:14:43,240
Got you.

258
00:14:51,879 --> 00:14:52,519
No, no!

259
00:14:52,519 --> 00:14:53,720
I quit! I quit!

260
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:54,879
I swear!

261
00:14:54,879 --> 00:14:55,840
I'm not giving them to you.

262
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:58,360
Can you tell which one Eagle gave you?

263
00:15:00,799 --> 00:15:01,240
This one.

264
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:04,600
You sure?

265
00:15:04,879 --> 00:15:05,279
Yes.

266
00:15:05,679 --> 00:15:06,480
I know this one for sure.

267
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:07,840
It's got "FY" printed on it.

268
00:15:10,159 --> 00:15:10,799
You know English?

269
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:11,639
Yeah.

270
00:15:11,919 --> 00:15:13,480
I learned it back in middle school.

271
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:16,519
ABC, "abc"...

272
00:15:16,799 --> 00:15:17,960
You can't even get that right.
Get out of here.

273
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:25,320
FY...

274
00:15:31,919 --> 00:15:34,519
Where'd you get this stuff?

275
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,720
Huogun and Dazui tracked down
the dealer.

276
00:15:37,879 --> 00:15:38,679
Let's go take a look.

277
00:15:40,919 --> 00:15:41,679
(Dongcheng Tiger)
Lin.

278
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:43,039
Lin.

279
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:50,559
Where are you going?

280
00:15:56,986 --> 00:16:00,253
♪They tell me not to walk head bowed♪

281
00:16:03,524 --> 00:16:06,484
♪They say look up to see the light♪

282
00:16:09,115 --> 00:16:12,435
♪I don't know what the light looks like♪

283
00:16:12,688 --> 00:16:16,502
♪All I know is the mud feels cold♪

284
00:16:23,215 --> 00:16:26,872
♪I used to believe I could
grit my teeth and make it through♪

285
00:16:29,777 --> 00:16:32,648
♪That if I endured it,
I'd come out whole♪

286
00:16:35,588 --> 00:16:38,903
♪But every morning,
when I look in the mirror♪

287
00:16:38,913 --> 00:16:41,087
♪The same face is still staring back
at me♪

288
00:16:41,939 --> 00:16:43,152
♪Stray dog, stray dog♪

289
00:16:45,628 --> 00:16:47,508
♪Stray dog, stray dog♪

290
00:16:58,697 --> 00:17:00,426
♪Stray dog, stray dog♪

291
00:17:17,684 --> 00:17:19,511
♪Run through this endless night♪
